WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Check the books against the Income-tax portal in SimplyFy: 26AS, AIS and TIS.

2
00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:19.768
Upload 26AS, AIS and TIS. A newer 26AS replaces the older one; your explanations stay.

3
00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:25.245
How much is cleared, and what still holds the year in Reconciling.

4
00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:35.463
TDS by deductor, income by head and each challan, books against portal. Red ones must be fixed or explained.

5
00:00:36.062 --> 00:00:41.722
Search the findings by words or an amount, together with the colour tabs.

6
00:00:42.343 --> 00:00:49.423
Write why a difference is right; once every red is explained the year moves to Review by itself.
